<title>SPAIN: Spanish bourse suspends Sefanitro trade.</title>
<headline>Spanish bourse suspends Sefanitro trade.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1996-11-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Spanish bourse suspended trade in shares of Sefanitro because of competing buy offers for the firm, the stock market commission CNMV said on Tuesday.</p>
</text>
